			"Message": "chore(Mountain): Update Tauri schema files with new permissions and deprecations\n\nUpdate generated Tauri schema files to reflect upstream permission changes:\n\n- Remove deprecated `dialog:allow-ask` and `dialog:allow-confirm` from default permissions (now aliases to `allow-message` for Tauri v3)\n- Add new fs permissions for macOS security-scoped resources (`start_accessing_security_scoped_resource`, `stop_accessing_security_scoped_resource`)\n- Add `core:event:allow-listen` to default capabilities for event-based IPC communication\n\nThese changes sync the local Tauri configuration with the latest Tauri plugin schemas.",
			"SHA": "143633578d6fd93a728beb05bef7ca907d215de7"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-07T05:30:26Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				684,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(Mountain): Configure Tauri CSP and capabilities for IPC communication\n\nAdd required Tauri v2 permissions and Content Security Policy settings to enable proper IPC communication between the Wind frontend and Mountain backend:\n- Add `ipc:` to connect-src in both production and development CSP configurations\n- Grant `core:event:allow-listen` permission for event-based communication\n- Add URL patterns for localhost and tauri.localhost in capabilities\n\nThese changes enable the Wind UI service layer to communicate with Mountain via Tauri's IPC mechanism.",
			"SHA": "c9389f3882507cc97fa7dba733a13961a6e49cb6"
		},
